{"seq":2,"slug":"transition-metal-chemistry","title":"过渡金属化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/descriptive-chemistry/transition-metal-chemistry","wordCount":1482,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"过渡金属化学\">过渡金属化学</h1><p>铁能是 +2 也能是 +3，锰从 +2 一路到 +7，铬的化合物红橙紫绿样样齐全——主族元素罕见这般「善变」。过渡金属之所以是工业与生命的主力，正在于它们可变的氧化态、缤纷的颜色与卓越的催化能力。这一篇是 d 区元素族群规律的详讲处，它大量调用<a href=\"../coordination-chemistry/crystal-field-ligand-field-theory\">晶体场与配位场理论</a>解释现象，但配位理论本身不在此重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>过渡金属是 d 轨道部分填充的元素（严格定义要求至少一种氧化态有未填满的 d 轨道）。它们的共性源于 (n−1)d 与 ns 轨道能量相近：成键时 s 电子先失、d 电子可逐个参与，于是产生连续的可变氧化态、易形成配合物、化合物多有颜色且常顺磁。第一过渡系（Sc–Zn）最常见，第二、三过渡系因镧系收缩半径相近、性质更接近彼此。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[过渡金属&lt;br/&gt;d 轨道部分填充] --&gt; B[ns 与 d 轨道能量相近]&#10;  B --&gt; C[可变氧化态]&#10;  B --&gt; D[易形成配合物]&#10;  D --&gt; E[d 轨道分裂&lt;br/&gt;见配位场理论]&#10;  E --&gt; F[颜色 d-d 跃迁]&#10;  E --&gt; G[磁性 未成对电子]&#10;  C --&gt; H[催化活性&lt;br/&gt;多价态切换]\">flowchart TD\n  A[过渡金属&lt;br/&gt;d 轨道部分填充] --&gt; B[ns 与 d 轨道能量相近]\n  B --&gt; C[可变氧化态]\n  B --&gt; D[易形成配合物]\n  D --&gt; E[d 轨道分裂&lt;br/&gt;见配位场理论]\n  E --&gt; F[颜色 d-d 跃迁]\n  E --&gt; G[磁性 未成对电子]\n  C --&gt; H[催化活性&lt;br/&gt;多价态切换]</pre><h2 id=\"可变氧化态及其规律\">可变氧化态及其规律</h2><p>可变氧化态是过渡金属最鲜明的标志。氧化态从左向右先升后降：钪只有 +3，到锰可达 +7（对应失去全部 3d+4s 电子），其后又回落，因为右侧元素的高氧化态需要拆开已成对的 d 电子、代价过高。最高氧化态通常出现在与强电负性的氧、氟结合时，如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>MnO</mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MnO}_4^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0916em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MnO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>CrO</mtext><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CrO}_4^{2-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1343em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CrO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>各氧化态的相对稳定性可用 CFSE 与电极电势分析：高氧化态强氧化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>MnO</mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MnO}_4^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0916em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MnO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Cr</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mtext>O</mtext><mn>7</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cr}_2\\text{O}_7^{2-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1343em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是常用氧化剂），低氧化态多为还原性。下表小结第一过渡系部分元素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元素</th>\n<th>常见氧化态</th>\n<th>标志性物种</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>钛 Ti</td>\n<td>+3, +4</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>TiO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TiO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TiO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>+4 最稳定、白色颜料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铬 Cr</td>\n<td>+2, +3, +6</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Cr</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mtext>O</mtext><mn>7</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cr}_2\\text{O}_7^{2-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1343em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>+6 强氧化、多彩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锰 Mn</td>\n<td>+2 到 +7</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>MnO</mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MnO}_4^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0916em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MnO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>氧化态跨度最大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁 Fe</td>\n<td>+2, +3</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Fe</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Fe}^{3+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fe</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>+3 在 +2 基础上更稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铜 Cu</td>\n<td>+1, +2</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Cu</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cu}^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cu</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>+1 在固态/配合物中稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"颜色与磁性的来源\">颜色与磁性的来源</h2><p>过渡金属化合物的颜色几乎都来自 d–d 电子跃迁：可见光中能量等于分裂能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的光子被吸收，电子从低能 d 轨道跃迁到高能 d 轨道，反射互补色。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>d</mtext><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{d}^0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">d</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Ti</mtext><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ti}^{4+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ti</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>d</mtext><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{d}^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">d</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Zn</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Zn}^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Zn</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）化合物无色——没有可供跃迁的 d 电子或空位。某些极深的颜色（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>MnO</mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MnO}_4^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0916em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MnO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的深紫）则来自电荷转移跃迁，强度远高于 d–d。</p>\n<p>磁性由未成对 d 电子数决定，顺磁性与磁矩计算的全部理论在<a href=\"../coordination-chemistry/crystal-field-ligand-field-theory\">晶体场与配位场理论</a>中详述，本篇只强调：同一金属离子在不同配体场中可呈高自旋或低自旋，从而磁性不同，这是判断配位环境的探针。</p>\n<p>颜色来源的两条通道可从下表区分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>跃迁类型</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>d</mtext><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{d}^0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">d</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>d</mtext><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{d}^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">d</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>典型例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>d–d 跃迁</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>不发生（无色）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Cu</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>NH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>4</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{Cu}(\\text{NH}_3)_4]^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cu</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 蓝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电荷转移</td>\n<td>很强</td>\n<td>可发生（颜色极深）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>MnO</mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MnO}_4^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0916em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MnO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 深紫</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"催化活性与冶金\">催化活性与冶金</h2><p>过渡金属是工业催化的支柱，核心优势正是可变氧化态——能在催化循环中反复切换价态、可逆地吸附与活化反应物。哈伯法合成氨用铁催化剂、接触法制硫酸用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>V</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{V}_2\\text{O}_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、汽车尾气净化用铂铑钯，无不依赖这一能力。均相催化中过渡金属配合物经历氧化加成与还原消除等步骤，其机理属<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/organometallic-catalysis\">有机金属化学与催化</a>的专题。</p>\n<p>冶金上，过渡金属及其合金（钢、不锈钢、合金钢）是现代工业的骨架；它们的物理性质（高熔点、高强度、导电导热）源于 d 电子参与的金属键，金属键的能带图像见<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/solid-state-materials-inorganic\">固体与材料无机化学</a>。在生命体系中，铁、铜、锌、钼等过渡金属占据酶活性中心的关键位置，详见<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/bioinorganic-chemistry\">生物无机化学</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"族群规律的横向梳理\">族群规律的横向梳理</h2><p>把第一过渡系横向扫一遍，能看到一条清晰的脉络。早期金属（Sc、Ti、V）半径较大、电正性强，倾向高氧化态且高氧化态相对稳定，氧化物多呈酸性或两性；中段（Cr、Mn）氧化态跨度最大，既能做强氧化剂又有稳定的低价态，化学最丰富；后段（Fe、Co、Ni、Cu）半径收缩、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_{\\text{eff}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增大，高氧化态越来越难达到，化学逐渐以 +2、+3 为主；末端的锌 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 满壳，已不算严格意义的过渡金属，化合物无色、氧化态固定为 +2，行为更像主族。</p>\n<p>纵向看，第二、三过渡系因<a href=\"lanthanides-actinides\">镧系收缩</a>而半径相近，但它们的高氧化态比第一过渡系更稳定（如钼、钨的 +6 远比铬的 +6 稳定），且更倾向低自旋、更易形成金属—金属键与多核簇合物。这种「越往下越稳定高价、越倾向强场低自旋」的规律，是它们在高温催化与特种合金中大显身手的根源。掌握这条横纵交织的地图，比孤立记忆单个元素的性质有效得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>过渡金属因 d 与 s 轨道能量相近而具可变氧化态、易配位、多颜色、常顺磁四大共性。</li>\n<li>氧化态从左向右先升后降，最高氧化态需强电负性配体支持，高氧化态物种多为强氧化剂。</li>\n<li>颜色来自 d–d 跃迁（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 无色）与电荷转移；磁性由未成对电子数定，理论回指配位场篇。</li>\n<li>可变价态使过渡金属成为工业催化与生命酶系的核心，相关机理分散于应用前沿三篇。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"过渡金属化学","id":"过渡金属化学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可变氧化态及其规律","id":"可变氧化态及其规律"},{"level":2,"text":"颜色与磁性的来源","id":"颜色与磁性的来源"},{"level":2,"text":"催化活性与冶金","id":"催化活性与冶金"},{"level":2,"text":"族群规律的横向梳理","id":"族群规律的横向梳理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"主族元素化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/descriptive-chemistry/main-group-chemistry"},"next":{"title":"镧系、锕系与稀土元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/descriptive-chemistry/lanthanides-actinides"}}